<title>USA: First Pacific Networks sells preferred.</title>
<headline>First Pacific Networks sells preferred.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Pacific Networks Inc said on Friday that it completed a private placement of 1,500 Series F Preferred shares with a purchase price of $1,500,000.</p>
<p>The Series F preferred is convertible into FPN Common Stock at a conversion rate of 80 percent of market value of FPN's Common Stock at the time of the conversion.</p>
</text>
